# Canonicalises committer identities so one person appears once in
# `git shortlog -sne`, `git log --author`, and GitHub's contributor graph.
#
# Format:  Canonical Name <canonical@email>  Other Name <other@email>
#
# MidhunAkash has committed under two display names with the same address.
MidhunAkash <midhunakash.m@ezil.work> Midhun Akash M <midhunakash.m@ezil.work>
MidhunAkash <midhunakash.m@ezil.work> MidhunAkash <midhunakash.m@ezil.work>
